WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Every text is a rehearsal for the exam.. Today's goal should beat yesterday's..

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Patience is the smartest form of speed.. Every day you delay the mock test, you

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
delay yourself.. You are a learner, not a number.. A good plan is stronger than

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
a good intention.. Record a small gain; records create motivation.. Do your

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
weakest skill a favour today.. You learn a language by erring, not by waiting..

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
A hard text means a strong brain..
